cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these analyses, please cite the paper below."
title: "CIS-EMA: observability analysis of an EMA-based silent speech interface"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and reference results for a feature-attribution and observability
  study of an EMA-based silent speech interface on 43 Cantonese isolated syllables,
  including exact Shapley decomposition, linear probing, acoustic recoverability,
  knowledge distillation, leave-one-coil-out sensor removal, and an external-validity
  replication on the public SAIT-EMA Mandarin corpus.
